  /// WalletTransaction row created by the balance reservation (PENDING lock)
  /// and settled on COMPLETED (or released on REJECTED/CANCELLED).
  walletTransactionId String? @unique

  /// Provider transaction reference once a gateway accepted the payout.
  providerReference String?

  /// Unique per request - the ledger idempotency key is `manual-wd:{id}`.
  idempotencyKey String @unique @default(uuid())

